 **           Bethe Salpeter equation (BSE) for excitation energies           **
 **                solved with Tamm-Dancoff approximation (TDA)               **
 **                                                                           **
 *******************************************************************************
  
 BSE| No cutoff given for occupied orbitals
 BSE| No cutoff given for empty orbitals
 BSE| First occupied index                                                     1
 BSE| Last empty index (not MO index!)                                        17
 BSE| Energy of first occupied index [eV]                               -563.606
 BSE| Energy of last empty index [eV]                                     38.358
 BSE| Energy difference of first occupied index to HOMO [eV]             554.270
 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                  40.392
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                      6
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                        17
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
